{
  "project": "WasmClient",
  "description": "Port the new flow-kit-example domains into WasmClient to restore parity with the latest prototype. Ordered lightest-first so the port pipeline is proven on a small domain before the heavy ones. Each feature follows the house pattern (namespace, struct-static-let wire values, proto mirror, interface + session + mocks + Live wiring + tests) and is verified via bazel-checker.",
